Z||000001||btoth||04-06-2001||02:12 PM||||There are the upsides and the downsides to having more topic forums.  The good side is that it neaten's things up and allows you to find what you're looking for when you're looking for a certain subject to read about.  (Provided the members are smart enough to post in the correct section in the first place.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"> )  <P>The problem is that it eventually creates a big mess.  I love comming here and just scrolling through the topics... it's harder to do that kind of thing on places such as the MR2 forum (or the Firebird forum, Miata forum etc.),  just too many areas to choose from that you get lost.<P>But I'm just rambling now and as long as we didn't get carried away with new sections it would probably be ok.  I like the idea of a section just for testing sigs and pics personally.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
